# Luxel library sprite — original art, Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A LOOP TILE: 16 frames, near flakes fall a pixel a frame and the far ones
# half that, so frame 16 is frame 0 again and the edges wrap. `fit tile` over
# a big box turns it into a full-panel snowfall with no pattern engine.
name: Snowfall Tile
fps: 8
palette:
  w ffffff
  s b8c8e0

